        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Brooklyn Nine-Nine\n- People: Stephanie Beatriz, Terry Crews, Melissa Fumero, Joe Lo Truglio, Chelsea Peretti, Dirk Blocker, Joel McKinnon Miller, Kyle Bornheimer\n- Roles: Rosa Diaz, Terrence \"Terry\" Jeffords, Amy Santiago, Charles Boyle, Regina \"Gina\" Linetti, Michael Hitchcock, Norman \"Norm\" Scully\n- Topics: Television cast, premiere viewership\n\nFacts:\n- Brooklyn Nine-Nine premiered on Fox on September 17, 2013.\n- Brooklyn Nine-Nine garnered 6.17 million viewers at its premiere.\n- Brooklyn Nine-Nine is an American police sitcom.\n- Stephanie Beatriz appears in Brooklyn Nine-Nine as Rosa Diaz.\n- Terry Crews appears in Brooklyn Nine-Nine as Terrence \"Terry\" Jeffords.\n- Melissa Fumero appears in Brooklyn Nine-Nine as Amy Santiago.\n- Joe Lo Truglio appears in Brooklyn Nine-Nine as Charles Boyle.\n- Chelsea Peretti appears in Brooklyn Nine-Nine as Regina \"Gina\" Linetti.\n- Dirk Blocker appears in Brooklyn Nine-Nine as Michael Hitchcock.\n- Joel McKinnon Miller appears in Brooklyn Nine-Nine as Norman \"Norm\" Scully.\n- Chelsea Vanessa Peretti was born on February 20, 1978.\n- Chelsea Vanessa Peretti is an American comedian, actress, and writer.\n- Kyle Bornheimer is known for a recurring role on Brooklyn Nine-Nine.",
